SUMMARY:Science Café: A visual natural history of insect jumping
DESCRIPTION:Photo: Adrian Smith \nGrab a bite from the Daily Planet Café and join host Chris Smith for our monthly Science Café. Gather with other curious minds at this after-hours event for an informal presentation and conversation about current science topics with guest experts. The Daily Planet Café is open 5–8pm with a full menu during the Science Café. \nTonight’s Topic \nGet ready for BugFest! Dr. Adrian Smith (NCMNS & YouTube/AntLab) will present a visual showcase of the surprising ways that bugs jump! The talk will highlight recent and ongoing research projects in the lab as well as slow-motion visual natural history from his YouTube channel Ant Lab. \nTonight’s Expert \nDr. Adrian Smith is Head of the Insect Research Lab at NCMNS and creator of the popular YouTube channel\, AntLab. \nAbout BugFest\nSeptember 19 10AM-7PM \nThree decades of creepy\, crawly and fluttering fun come together for the Museum’s biggest celebration yet. This year’s theme\, “Hoppers\,” spotlights treehoppers\, planthoppers and leafhoppers. \nExplore more than 100 exhibits\, crafts\, games and activities celebrating the world of arthropods. Ask entomologists and other scientists about all things bugs. Satisfy your curiosity and appetite with buggy culinary creations at Café Insecta. Enjoy science talks and live performances throughout the day. \nFREE and for all ages.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/science-cafe-a-visual-natural-history-of-insect-jumping/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Daily Planet Cafe,Discussions,Educators,General Events,K-12 Students,Lectures,Science Cafes,Teens
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Smith":MAILTO:christopher.smith@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Downtown Raleigh 11 West Jones Street Raleigh NC 27601 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=11 West Jones Street:geo:-78.6395502,35.7822735
END:VEVENT
